AI masking models (see `SMART --download-mask-model`) are put here:
 - sam2.1_hiera_{tiny,small,base_plus,large}_{encoder,decoder}.onnx: SAM 2.1
   (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2) converted with
   tools/export_sam2_onnx.py
 - (the old PyTorch checkpoints sam2.1_hiera_*.pt and big-lama.pt are not
   used any more, apart from by tools/export_sam2_onnx.py)

AI healing models (see `SMART --download-heal-model`) are also put here:
 - big-lama-dynamic-coreml.onnx: LaMa big-lama export by greycard
   (Apache-2.0, https://huggingface.co/jessolmstead/greycard-lama), adapted
   for the CoreML provider with tools/make_lama_coreml.py (it runs on every
   provider)

Raw denoising models (see `SMART --download-denoise-model`) are also put here:
 - denoise-v19.onnx (small), denoise-v15.onnx (medium), denoise-v20.onnx
   (large): greycard, GPL-3.0,
   https://huggingface.co/jessolmstead/greycard-denoise
 - treenet-light.onnx (small), treenet.onnx (medium), treenet-heavy.onnx
   (large), for linear DNGs: RawForge TreeNet, MIT,
   https://huggingface.co/AyedaOk/rawlab-models

AI upscaling models (see `SMART --download-upscale-model`) are also put here:
 - real_esrgan_x2.onnx, real_esrgan_x4.onnx: Real-ESRGAN x2plus / x4plus
   (BSD-3-Clause), ONNX export by SceneWorks,
   https://huggingface.co/SceneWorks/real-esrgan-onnx
